sequenceDiagram

participant Producer
participant Notifier
participant Registration as Registration Store
participant Queue as PostgreSQL Queue
participant Poller
participant Scheduler
participant Worker
participant Customer

Producer->>Notifier: POST subscriber event
Notifier->>Registration: Resolve webhook URLs by customer
Registration-->>Notifier: Active webhook URLs
Notifier->>Queue: Insert pending delivery rows
Queue-->>Notifier: Delivery rows persisted
Notifier-->>Producer: 202 Accepted

loop Poll interval
    Poller->>Queue: Claim available pending rows
    Queue-->>Poller: Claimed delivery jobs
    Poller->>Scheduler: Enqueue claimed jobs
end

Scheduler->>Worker: Dispatch next customer job
Worker->>Customer: HTTP POST webhook
Customer-->>Worker: 200 OK
Worker->>Queue: Mark row completed
Queue-->>Worker: Completion persisted
